# Feature 011 (D4, research R3): a cuems-common without the /etc/cuems
# handover ships /etc/cuems/network_map.{xml,xsd} as conffiles. This package
# installs the current network_map.xsd into /etc/cuems from postinst on every
# configure, so such a cuems-common left beside it would record that file as
# its own modified conffile and prompt or park a .dpkg-dist on its next
# upgrade. Breaks makes apt upgrade the pair together. Replaces is
# deliberately absent: nothing under /etc is in this package's manifest (D5),
# so there is no file overlap for Replaces to license.
# Feature 016: the bound was (<< 1.3.0-23~), but cuems-common 1.3.0-23, -24
# and -25 were then RELEASED from its debian/bookworm line WITHOUT the
# handover, and that bound admitted them. The handover ships in 1.3.1-1, so
# the bound moves with the version.
Breaks: cuems-common (<< 1.3.1~)
Description: Cuems utils
 Cuems utils is a set of utilities to work with the cuems project